bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/0 group-hover:border-mlbb-gold/50 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #2ECC71, transparent)"></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors font-heading uppercase tracking-wider" href="/heroes">Browse All Heroes<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></section></div></section></div><section class="content-lazy relative border-t border-border-subtle py-12 md:py-16" aria-labelledby="hero-faq-heading"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/natalia#faq","url":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/natalia","inLanguage":"en","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best Natalia build in 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Natalia's strongest build centers on Blade of the Heptaseas, Endless Battle and Hunter Strike as core items, paired with the Assassin Emblem and the Retribution battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best emblem for Natalia?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The recommended emblem for Natalia is Assassin Emblem, set up with the Rupture, Seasoned Hunter and Killing Spree talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What lane and role is Natalia in Mobile Legends?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Natalia is an Assassin hero, usually played as a Jungler and as a Roamer. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who counters Natalia?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Natalia is countered most by Cyclops, Mathilda and Karina, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Natalia in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Natalia beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Natalia hard to play?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Natalia is rated Hard difficulty in Mobile Legends. Natalia has a higher skill floor, so expect a learning curve on combos and positioning before the hero pays off."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Natalia's win rate this patch?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Natalia currently holds a 51.1% win rate, a 0.3% pick rate, and a 1.3% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section."}}]}</script><div class="container-mlbb relative z-10"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-gold/10 text-text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><h2 id="hero-faq-heading" class="font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-text-accent-bright md:text-2xl">Natalia FAQ</h2></div><p class="mb-6 max-w-[80ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted md:text-[15px]">Natalia is an Assassin hero played as a Jungler and as a Roamer.<!-- --> Its strongest build centers on Blade of the Heptaseas, Endless Battle, Hunter Strike; open the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/build-simulator?hero=natalia&amp;items=swift-boots%2Cblade-of-the-heptaseas%2Cendless-battle%2Chunter-strike%2Cmalefic-roar%2Cimmortality&amp;blessing=ice-retribution&amp;spell=retribution&amp;emblem=assassin&amp;talents=rupture%2Cseasoned-hunter%2Ckilling-spree&amp;flex=tough-boots.swift-boots%2Cblade-of-despair.immortality%2Csea-halberd.immortality">Natalia build simulator</a> for the full item order and final stats, or compare every available loadout on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/builds/natalia">Natalia builds page</a>. <!-- -->See every hero that beats it on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/counter/natalia">Natalia counter page</a>.</p><div class="space-y-3"><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best Natalia build in 2026?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 rotate-180 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Natalia&#x27;s strongest build centers on Blade of the Heptaseas, Endless Battle and Hunter Strike as core items, paired with the Assassin Emblem and the Retribution battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best emblem for Natalia?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">The recommended emblem for Natalia is Assassin Emblem, set up with the Rupture, Seasoned Hunter and Killing Spree talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_valubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What lane and role is Natalia in Mobile Legends?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_valubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Natalia is an Assassin hero, usually played as a Jungler and as a Roamer. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Who counters Natalia?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Natalia is countered most by Cyclops, Mathilda and Karina, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Natalia in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Natalia beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Is Natalia hard to play?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Natalia is rated Hard difficulty in Mobile Legends. Natalia has a higher skill floor, so expect a learning curve on combos and positioning before the hero pays off.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is Natalia&#x27;s win rate this patch?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Natalia currently holds a 51.1% win rate, a 0.3% pick rate, and a 1.3% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class="content-lazy relative bg-[#000000] border-t border-[#C8AA6E]/20 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 hex-pattern opacity-40 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(200,170,110,0.03), transparent)"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] z-10 overflow-hidden energy-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 pt-4 pb-4"><div class="container-mlbb"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-x-12 gap-y-8"><div class="col-span-1 sm:col-span-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-7 h-7 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67