031336.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/natalia/Natalia-Warrioress-Paragon-20240725093511.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Natalia/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Soul Huntress\",\"tier\":\"Deluxe\",\"rawTier\":\"Deluxe\",\"tag\":\"Epic\",\"tagSlug\":\"epic\",\"price\":\"899\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero249-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/natalia/Hero249-portrait-20250530071935.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/natalia/Natalia-Soul-Huntress-20251219115608.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Natalia/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Rogue Mamba\",\"tier\":\"Common\",\"rawTier\":\"Common\",\"tag\":\"Elite\",\"tagSlug\":\"elite\",\"price\":\"Celestial Chest Reward\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero244-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/natalia/Hero244-portrait-20240121134638.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Natalia/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Crimson Raven\",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":\"Special\",\"tagSlug\":\"special\",\"price\":\"2021/03 StarLight Reward\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero245-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/natalia/Hero245-portrait-20240121134727.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Natalia/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Natalia is the elite assassin of the Imperial Knighthood, a phantom operative who has served the Moniyan Empire from the shadows for longer than most knights have been alive. Her mastery of stealth is absolute. She can vanish from sight entirely, her smoke bomb rendering her invisible as she stalks behind enemy lines to silence high-value targets. Her twin daggers strike from concealment with lethal precision, and by the time her victims realize she is there, it is already too late. Natalia's unwavering loyalty to the Empire is matched only by her ruthless efficiency, making her the most feared name whispered in the corridors of power across the Land of Dawn.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"saber\",\"heroName\":\"Saber\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow elite operative who coordinates strikes with her\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"lancelot\",\"heroName\":\"Lancelot\",\"relationship\":\"Moniyan noble who provides intelligence for her missions\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"hayabusa\",\"heroName\":\"Hayabusa\",\"relationship\":\"Shadow ninja whose stealth techniques rival her own\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"karina\",\"heroName\":\"Karina\",\"relationship\":\"Shadow elf assassin who competes for the same marks\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"$undefined\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":51.46,\"pickRate\":0.33,\"banRate\":2.41},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":51.34,\"pickRate\":0.33,\"banRate\":2.4},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":51.07,\"pickRate\":0.33,\"banRate\":2.38},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":50.87,\"pickRate\":0.29,\"banRate\":1.33},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":50.85,\"pickRate\":0.28,\"banRate\":1.35},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":50.9,\"pickRate\":0.26,\"banRate\":1.3},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":51.08,\"pickRate\":0.25,\"banRate\":1.29}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Natalia\",\"heroSlug\":\"natalia\",\"roles\":\"$60:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$60:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":3,\"winRate\":51.08,\"pickRate\":0.25,\"banRate\":1.29,\"curatedBuilds\":\"$60:props:curatedBuilds\",\"topCounters\":\"$60:props:tabData:counterData:countersThisHero\",\"hasCounterPage\":true,\"hasRankStats\":true,\"locale\":\"en\",\"pageUrl\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/natalia\",\"year\":2026}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"6a:I[313915,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6b:I[279344,[\"$